slug: bone-density-dexa-scans
title: Bone Density (DEXA) Scans — T-scores, Fracture Risk and Exercise
area: Imaging & Reports
level: Clinical
best: Final year onwards
minutes: 10
hook: A DEXA report gives a "T-score" that patients often fear. Learn what it measures, what the numbers mean and how to use the result to plan safe, bone-friendly exercise. || DEXA report "T-score" deti hai jis se mareez aksar dartay hain. Seekhein yeh kya naapta hai, numbers ka matlab kya hai aur nateeje ko hadi-dost mehfooz exercise ke plan ke liye kaise istemal karein.
goal: By the end, you'll explain what a DEXA scan measures, read a T-score and a Z-score, name the WHO categories, understand why a score is not the same as fracture risk and plan exercise safely around it. || End tak aap samjhayenge ke DEXA scan kya naapta hai, T-score aur Z-score parhenge, WHO categories batayenge, samjhenge ke score fracture ke khatre ke barabar kyun nahi aur us ke gird mehfooz exercise ka plan banayenge.

say: **DEXA** (dual-energy X-ray absorptiometry) uses a very low radiation dose to measure **bone mineral density** at the **spine and hip**. The result is given as a **T-score**: how many standard deviations the patient's bone density is from the average of a healthy young adult. By the WHO definition: **normal is -1.0 or higher, low bone mass (osteopenia) is between -1.0 and -2.5, and osteoporosis is -2.5 or lower**. A **Z-score** compares the patient with people of the same age and sex and is used in younger people. || **DEXA** (dual-energy X-ray absorptiometry) bohat kam radiation se **reedh aur hip** par **haddi ki mineral density** naapta hai. Nateeja **T-score** mein hota hai: mareez ki haddi ki density sehatmand jawan ke ausat se kitne standard deviations door hai. WHO ki tareef: **normal -1.0 ya zyada, kam haddi (osteopenia) -1.0 se -2.5 ke beech, aur osteoporosis -2.5 ya kam**. **Z-score** mareez ka muqabla usi umar aur jins ke logon se karta hai aur jawan logon mein istemal hota hai.
analogy: Think of bone density as **the thickness of a wall**. A T-score tells you how thick the wall is compared with a new building. But how likely the wall is to fall in a storm also depends on its shape, its age and the wind (falls, age, past fractures). That is why a score is a piece of the picture and not the whole risk. || Haddi ki density ko **deewar ki motai** samjhein. T-score batata hai deewar naye makan ke muqable mein kitni moti hai. Magar toofan mein deewar girne ka imkaan us ki shakl, umar aur hawa (girna, umar, pichle fractures) par bhi munhasir hai. Isi liye score tasveer ka hissa hai, poora khatra nahi.
steps: Using a DEXA report || DEXA report istemal karna
step: Read the sites and the scores :: Check the spine, hip (total and femoral neck) and sometimes the forearm. The lowest T-score at the main sites is used for the category. || Sites aur scores parhein :: Reedh, hip (total aur femoral neck) aur kabhi kalai dekhein. Mukhya sites par sab se kam T-score category ke liye istemal hota hai.
step: Check for traps :: Arthritis in the spine, a previous fracture or calcified vessels can falsely raise the spine reading. Check whether there was a vertebral fracture assessment, which finds spine fractures without a full X-ray. || Jaal check karein :: Reedh ki arthritis, pichla fracture ya calcified nasain reedh ki reading ghalat taur par barha sakti hain. Dekhein kya vertebral fracture assessment hua, jo poore X-ray ke baghair reedh ke fractures dhoondta hai.
step: Combine with fracture risk :: Fracture risk depends on age, previous fractures, falls, family history, steroids and other factors. Tools such as FRAX combine them. Ask what the doctor's overall risk estimate is. || Fracture ke khatre se milayein :: Fracture ka khatra umar, pichle fractures, girna, khandan ki history, steroids aur doosre asbaab par munhasir hai. FRAX jaise tools unhein milate hain. Poochhein doctor ka mukammal khatre ka andaza kya hai.
step: Plan exercise and falls prevention :: Use weight-bearing, resistance and balance exercise for every category, adjust impact and spine loading for severe osteoporosis or a spine fracture, and teach falls prevention. || Exercise aur girne se bachao ka plan :: Har category ke liye wazan uthane wali, resistance aur balance exercise istemal karein, shadeed osteoporosis ya reedh ke fracture mein impact aur reedh ki loading badlein, aur girne se bachao sikhayein.

check: What T-score range is osteoporosis by the WHO definition? || WHO ki tareef ke mutabiq osteoporosis ka T-score kitna hai?
ok: -2.5 or lower || -2.5 ya kam || Yes — osteopenia lies between -1.0 and -2.5. || Haan — osteopenia -1.0 se -2.5 ke beech hai.
no: -1.0 or higher || -1.0 ya zyada || That is normal. || Yeh normal hai.
no: Between -1.0 and -2.5 || -1.0 se -2.5 ke beech || That is low bone mass (osteopenia). || Yeh kam haddi (osteopenia) hai.
compare: Same T-score, different risk || Ek jaisa T-score, mukhtalif khatra
head: Feature || Khasiyat ;; 58-year-old, active, no falls || 58 saal, active, girna nahi ;; 78-year-old, frequent falls, past fracture || 78 saal, baar baar girna, pichla fracture
row: T-score || T-score ;; -2.6 || -2.6 ;; -2.6 || -2.6
row: Fracture risk || Fracture ka khatra ;; Lower || Kam ;; Much higher || Bohat zyada
row: Priority || Tarjeeh ;; Strength, impact and diet; medical review of treatment || Taaqat, impact aur khuraak; ilaj ka medical review ;; Falls prevention, balance, strength, safe movement and medical treatment || Girne se bachao, balance, taaqat, mehfooz harkat aur medical ilaj
row: Key message || Aham paigham ;; Build and protect bone || Haddi banayein aur bachayein ;; Prevent falls first, protect the spine || Pehle girna rokein, reedh bachayein
memory: **Score plus story.** A T-score tells you the bone density; the patient's age, falls and fractures tell you the risk. Plan exercise for the whole person, and do not label anyone as "fragile". || **Score aur kahani.** T-score haddi ki density batata hai; mareez ki umar, girna aur fractures khatra batate hain. Poore shakhs ke liye exercise ka plan banayein, aur kisi ko "kamzor" ka label na dein.
mistake: **Telling a patient with osteopenia or osteoporosis to avoid exercise.** Inactivity makes bone and muscle weaker and falls more likely. Exercise is safe and part of treatment. Adjust it for the spine and the risk of falls, rather than stopping. || **Osteopenia ya osteoporosis ke mareez ko exercise se bachne ko kehna.** Be-harkati haddi aur muscle kamzor karti hai aur girna zyada mumkin banati hai. Exercise mehfooz hai aur ilaj ka hissa hai. Reedh aur girne ke khatre ke mutabiq badlein, rokein nahi.
check: A DEXA report says osteopenia at the hip but the patient has had two low-trauma fractures. What is most important? || DEXA report mein hip par osteopenia hai magar mareez ko do halke-trauma ke fractures ho chuke hain. Sab se ahem kya hai?
ok: Her fracture history shows high risk, so she needs medical assessment and a falls and strength plan || Fracture ki history zyada khatra dikhati hai, is liye use medical assessment aur girne se bachao aur taaqat ka plan chahiye || Yes — prior fractures are among the strongest predictors, whatever the T-score. || Haan — pichle fractures sab se mazboot peshgoiyon mein hain, T-score kuch bhi ho.
no: The T-score is only osteopenia, so no action is needed || T-score sirf osteopenia hai, is liye kaarwai ki zaroorat nahi || The history changes the risk. || History khatra badal deti hai.
no: She should stop all exercise || Use tamam exercise band karni chahiye || Safe exercise helps. || Mehfooz exercise madad karti hai.
check: Which spine finding can falsely raise a DEXA reading? || Reedh ki kaun si finding DEXA reading ko ghalat taur par barha sakti hai?
ok: Spinal arthritis or a vertebral fracture || Reedh ki arthritis ya vertebral fracture || Yes — extra bone in the scan area adds to the reading. || Haan — scan ke hissay mein zyada haddi reading mein shamil hoti hai.
no: A very thin patient || Bohat patla mareez || That does not raise the reading. || Isse reading nahi barhti.
no: A healthy hip || Sehatmand hip || That reads correctly. || Yeh theek parhta hai.
clinic: **Give a hopeful, active message.** For example: "Your bones are a little thinner than average, which is common. Bone responds to load, so we will build strength, balance and walking, and your doctor will advise on treatment." Avoid words like "brittle" or "crumbling". || **Ummeed aur harkat ka paigham dein.** Maslan: "Aap ki haddiyan ausat se thori patli hain, jo aam hai. Haddi load par jawab deti hai, is liye hum taaqat, balance aur chalna banayenge, aur aap ka doctor ilaj ka mashwara dega." "Brittle" ya "bhurbhura" jaise alfaz se bachein.
reveal: Why is the T-score not the same as fracture risk? || T-score fracture ke khatre ke barabar kyun nahi? || Most fractures happen in people whose T-score is in the osteopenia range or only just in the osteoporosis range, because they are more numerous. Fractures also depend on falls, bone quality and structure, age and previous fractures, none of which the density score alone captures. || Zyada tar fractures un logon mein hote hain jin ka T-score osteopenia ki range mein ya osteoporosis ki hadd par hota hai, kyunke woh zyada hote hain. Fractures girne, haddi ki quality aur saakht, umar aur pichle fractures par bhi munhasir hain, jinhein akela density score nahi pakarta.
case: A 66-year-old woman has a hip T-score of -2.7 and no fractures. She is active and fears she will "break a bone" if she exercises. Her balance is good. || She has osteoporosis by density, with no fractures or falls, so exercise is safe and helpful with sensible spine care. || Explain, teach resistance and balance exercises, safe lifting with a hip hinge, avoid loaded spinal flexion, and encourage her doctor's treatment and calcium and vitamin D as advised. || At three months she is stronger and confident, and her balance remains good.
safety: **Seek medical review** for sudden new back pain or loss of height (a possible vertebral fracture), a fall with severe pain, or new weakness or numbness. After a fracture, follow the surgeon's advice before loading the area. Do not advise starting, stopping or changing osteoporosis medicines. || **Medical review karwayein** achanak nayi peeth ka dard ya qad mein kami (mumkin vertebral fracture), girne ke baad shadeed dard, ya nayi kamzori ya sunn hona. Fracture ke baad hissay par load se pehle surgeon ka mashwara maanein. Osteoporosis ki dawaiyan shuru, band ya badalne ka mashwara na dein.
summary: DEXA measures bone density at the spine and hip; the T-score classifies it (normal -1.0 or higher, osteopenia -1.0 to -2.5, osteoporosis -2.5 or lower). || DEXA reedh aur hip par haddi ki density naapta hai; T-score isay classify karta hai (normal -1.0 ya zyada, osteopenia -1.0 se -2.5, osteoporosis -2.5 ya kam).
summary: Fracture risk also depends on age, falls and previous fractures, so read the score with the patient's story. || Fracture ka khatra umar, girne aur pichle fractures par bhi munhasir hai, is liye score ko mareez ki kahani ke saath parhein.
summary: Exercise is safe and part of treatment: weight-bearing, resistance and balance training with sensible spine care and falls prevention. || Exercise mehfooz hai aur ilaj ka hissa: wazan uthane wali, resistance aur balance training, reedh ki ehtiyat aur girne se bachao ke saath.
card: What does a DEXA scan measure? || DEXA scan kya naapta hai? || Bone mineral density, usually at the spine and hip. || Haddi ki mineral density, aam taur par reedh aur hip par.
card: What T-score means osteoporosis? || Kaun sa T-score osteoporosis hai? || -2.5 or lower. || -2.5 ya kam.
card: What is a Z-score? || Z-score kya hai? || A comparison with people of the same age and sex. || Usi umar aur jins ke logon se muqabla.
card: Name one thing that raises fracture risk beyond the score. || Score ke ilawa fracture ka khatra barhane wali ek cheez batayein. || A previous fracture, falls, older age or steroid use. || Pichla fracture, girna, zyada umar ya steroid ka istemal.
deeper: Osteoporosis exercise lesson || /learn/osteoporosis-exercise-bone-health || Exercising safely with fragile bone. || Kamzor haddi ke saath mehfooz exercise.
deeper: Falls prevention lesson || /learn/falls-prevention-older-adults || The balance and strength programme that prevents fractures. || Balance aur strength programme jo fractures se bachata hai.
source: Kanis JA, Cooper C, Rizzoli R, Reginster JY. European guidance for the diagnosis and management of osteoporosis in postmenopausal women. Osteoporos Int 2019;30:3-44. || European guidance diagnosis management osteoporosis postmenopausal women
source: Giangregorio LM, McGill S, Wark JD, et al. Too Fit To Fracture: outcomes of a Delphi consensus process on physical activity and exercise recommendations for adults with osteoporosis with or without vertebral fractures. Osteoporos Int 2015;26:891-910. || Too Fit To Fracture exercise recommendations osteoporosis
